OL,3,AYouth charged after shopping centre
OL,4,Aattack leaves teenager in hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA youth has been charged after an
OL,7,Fapparent gang attack inside a Glasgow
OL,8,Fshopping centre left a teenager needing
OL,9,Fhospital treatment.
OL,11,FVideo posted on social media shows the
OL,12,Fyoung man, who was using a crutch and
OL,13,Fwearing a medical boot, being knocked
OL,14,Fto the ground, then repeatedly punched
OL,15,Fand kicked inside the St Enoch Centre
OL,16,Fon Friday afternoon.
OL,18,FA second person was also pushed to the
OL,19,Fground during the disturbance but
OL,20,Fsecurity staff intervened.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
