OL,3,AYouth charged after shopping centre
OL,4,Aattack leaves teenager in hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Scotland said the 19-year-old
OL,7,Fwas taken to hospital and a 17-year-old
OL,8,Fboy was later arrested and charged
OL,9,Ffollowing investigations.
